      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの人は魔導アーマー隊を率い、\r\n「帝国の盾」と呼ばれるほど、みなから尊敬されていたからな。",
        "official_en": "We all did. He was commander of the magitek armor legion—the “Shield of the Empire” himself. You’d be hard-pressed to find a soldier who didn’t respect him.",
        "real_en": "He led the magitek armor corps, and everyone respected him so much they called him the “Shield of the Empire.”"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
